epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"14a6ca0c5933e97130da8de039bcc57b1498a666","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/commits/14a6ca0c5933e97130da8de039bcc57b1498a666","created_at":"2021-05-06T07:39:13Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/833315730","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/52997#issuecomment-833315730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/52997","id":833315730,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgzMzMxNTczMA==","user":{"login":"DaveCTurner","id":5058284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTgyODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5058284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveCTurner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-05-06T07:57:42Z","updated_at":"2021-05-06T07:57:42Z","body":"I'd rather not set a default TTL because that would result in tearing down and re-establishing connections unnecessarily in environments that don't need it. I also don't see a sensible choice for the default: something like 60s seems short for networks that don't need it, but is already long enough that it won't fix the problem on other networks.\r\n\r\nWith properly-configured TCP keepalives the TTL should not be necessary anyway, so this gives us the best of both worlds: it should let us keep connections open forever even on networks that impose idle-connection timeouts.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/833315730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"DaveCTurner","id":5058284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTgyODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5058284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveCTurner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveCTurner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4702181392,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQ3MDIxODEzOTI=","url":"https